id: hostile-chase
name: Hostile Chase
kind: signature
side: disadvantages
tpCost: -7
requirement: 2+ ranks of the Homing Advantage, Energy or Magic Foundation
requires: ranks:homing>=2, foundation:energy|foundation:magic
summary: A Botch on a Strike, or a Critical Dodge against it, and it hits you (Urgent Wound).
description: >
  Your attacks that do not hit their marks run the risk of hitting you.
text: >
  Hostile Chase: Your attacks that do not hit their marks run the risk of hitting you.
  –TP Cost: -7
  –Requirement: 2+ ranks of the Homing Advantage, Energy or Magic Foundation
  –Effect: If you score a Botch Result on any Strike Roll made for this Attacking Maneuver, or your Opponent scored a Critical Result on their Dodge Roll against this Attacking Maneuver, you are hit by this Attacking Maneuver. Roll Wound as an Urgent Roll and apply Damage as you would normally.

---

# No script: what this does is read where the Technique is built or the attack is rolled
# (module/technique.mjs, module/signature.mjs). See the plan's feature table.
